{title: Tu Aata Hai Seene Me}
{artist: M S Dhoni Palak Muchhal Amaal Malik}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm] [C],        Tu aata hai seene mein
[Am] [A#],        Jab jab saansein bharti hoon
[Dm] [C],        Tere dil ki galiyon se
[Am] [A#],        Main har roz guzarti hoon
[Dm] [C],        Hawaa ke jaise chalta hai tu
[Am] [A#],        Main ret jaisi udti hoon
[Dm] [C],        Kaun tujhe yun pyar karega
[Am] [A#],        Jaise main karti hoon
[Dm] [C],        Ho ho hoohoho
[Am] [A#],        Ha ha ha haha ha ha
[Dm] [A#],        Meri nazar ka safar
[F] [C],        Tujhpe hi aake ruke
[Dm] [A#],        Kehne ko baaqi hai kya
[F] [C],        Kehna tha jo keh chuke
[Dm],        Meri nigaahein hain
[A#],        Teri nigahon ki
[F] [C],        tujhe khabar kya be-khabar
[Dm] [C],        Main tujhse hi chhup chhup kar
[Am] [A#],        Teri aankhen padhta hoon
[Dm] [C],        Kaun tujhe yun pyaar karega
[Am] [A#],        Jaise main karta hoon
[Dm] [C],        Ho ho?.
[Am] [A#],        Ha ha ha
[Dm] [A#],        Tu jo mujhe aa mila
[F] [C],        Sapne hue sirphire
[Dm] [A#],        Hathon mein aate nahi
[F] [C],        Udte hain lamhe mere
[Dm],        Meri hansi tujhse
[A#],        Meri khushi tujhse
[F] [C],        Tujhe khabar kya be-qadar
[Dm] [C],        Jis din tujhko na dekhun
[Am] [A#],        Pagal pagal phirti hoon
[Dm] [C],        Kaun tujhe yun pyaar karega
[Am] [A#],        Jaise main karti hoon
